  "question": {
    "text": "Tangent and normal are drawn at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> on the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, which intersect the axis of the parabola at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>, respectively. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is the center&nbsp;of the circle through the points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> and <math><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then a value of <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math> is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "1Nmls",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
